<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Volusia County IDA $23 mln.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Volusia County IDA $23 mln.</headline>
<text>
<p>VOLUSIA COUNTY INDUSTRIAL DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $23,340,000</p>
<p>FIRST MORTGAGE REVENUE AND REFUNDING BONDS</p>
<p>BISHOP'S GLEN PROJECT</p>
<p>SERIES 1996</p>
<p>WE HAVE RECEIVED THE WRITTEN AWARD.</p>
<p>TRADE DATE WILL BE TODAY 11/25/96.</p>
<p>MOODY'S: NR		    S&amp;P: NR</p>
<p>DATED: 11/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 05/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 11/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT     COUPON</p>
<p>11/01/2006		1,010M    7.125 %</p>
<p>11/01/2016		5,405M    7.50  %</p>
<p>11/01/2026	     16,925M    7.625 %</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 11/01/2006 at 102.00, DTP 11/01/2008.</p>
<p>The award is today, Monday, November 25, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is firm for December 5, 1996.</p>
<p>Wheat First Butcher Singer</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
